<myopenmath xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" id="270167">
<statement>
<p>
Let <m>\displaystyle{S}</m> be the universal set, where: </p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{S}={\left\lbrace{1},{2},{3},\ldots,{23},{24},{25}\right\rbrace}</m></p>
<p> Let sets <m>\displaystyle{A}</m> and <m>\displaystyle{B}</m> be subsets of <m>\displaystyle{S}</m>, where:</p>
<p>
Set <m>\displaystyle{A}={\left\lbrace{3},{5},{6},{8},{13},{18},{20},{23},{24}\right\rbrace}</m> </p>
<p> Set <m>\displaystyle{B}={\left\lbrace{1},{3},{9},{21}\right\rbrace}</m>  </p>
<p> Set <m>\displaystyle{C}={\left\lbrace{2},{11},{12},{21},{22},{25}\right\rbrace}</m></p>
<p>
Write the set <m>\displaystyle{A}\cup{B}\cup{C}</m> in roster notation. If the result is the empty set, enter <em>DNE</em></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cup{B}\cup{C}</m> = <lbrace/> <fillin characters="40" /> <rbrace/> </p>
<p>
Write the set <m>\displaystyle{A}\cap{B}\cap{C}</m> in roster notation. If the result is the empty set, enter <em>DNE</em></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cap{B}\cap{C}</m> = <lbrace/> <fillin characters="40" /> <rbrace/> </p>
</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>1,2,3,5,6,8,9,11,12,13,18,20,21,22,23,24,25</li><li>DNE</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

